## Key Concepts
- Dynamic active-channel management (4–6)
- Forgetting-factor whitening for nonstationarity
- Strategy switching: per-bin ICA vs joint diagonalization
- Dropout imputation via subspace projection
- Cross-bin permutation maintenance under channel changes
- Low-latency real-time constraints and evaluation plan

## Code Example
